.md
## Better compatibility with WL 14.0–15.0
We significantly improved symbol rendering, added various styling options for new plotting functions, and improved the output forms of new symbols.

### Exception objects
For example, an `Exception` object now shows relevant information:

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Display: markdown
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
## Better compatibility with WL 14.0–15.0
We significantly improved symbol rendering, added various styling options for new plotting functions, and improved the output forms of new symbols.

### Exception objects
For example, an `Exception` object now shows relevant information:

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Exception["DataConsistencyError"]

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Exception[(*VB[*) {"DataConsistencyError"}, <|"ExceptionValidated" -> True, "ExceptionAPIVersion" -> "1"|> (*,*)(*"1:"*)(*]VB*)]

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Props:
  Hidden: true
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
.md
Throw and catch exceptions:

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Display: markdown
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Throw and catch exceptions:

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
CatchExceptions[
  1+ThrowException[Exception["Null"]],
  All
]

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Failure[(*VB[*) "Null", <|"ExceptionAPIVersion" -> "1", "ExceptionTagList" -> {"Null"}|> (*,*)(*"1:"*)(*]VB*)]

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Props:
  Hidden: true
Type: Input
